1
00:00:07,461 --> 00:00:11,679
This is Part 5 of 6:
One taste, many faces.

2
00:00:12,494 --> 00:00:16,653
So far I have asked whether dependent
arising is as plain as it sounds,

3
00:00:16,733 --> 00:00:21,545
set out what it says and what it is for,
and followed how it is first met as a

4
00:00:21,625 --> 00:00:24,819
taste after anatta, and met again, free.

5
00:00:24,899 --> 00:00:27,962
Now the taste itself,
and how it is described.

6
00:00:28,781 --> 00:00:33,855
I say dependent arising is spontaneous
presence. They are not two things.

7
00:00:34,665 --> 00:00:38,892
Dependent arising is how the taste
is described when we analyse.

8
00:00:38,972 --> 00:00:42,968
These conditions, met
together, designated, working.

9
00:00:43,048 --> 00:00:48,131
Spontaneous presence is how it is
described when the habit of fixing stops.

10
00:00:48,211 --> 00:00:51,528
Complete, effortless,
with nothing behind it.

11
00:00:51,608 --> 00:00:54,412
And there is a third description: anatta.

12
00:00:55,226 --> 00:00:57,501
Three descriptions, one taste.

13
00:00:58,313 --> 00:01:00,651
Anatta says no one is behind it.

14
00:01:00,731 --> 00:01:02,689
No seer, no doer.

15
00:01:02,769 --> 00:01:04,890
Its guard: it is not a blank.

16
00:01:04,970 --> 00:01:06,634
Nobody disappears.

17
00:01:07,437 --> 00:01:11,039
Dependent arising says nothing
in it stands on its own.

18
00:01:11,119 --> 00:01:14,802
Conditions meet, and none
is found from its own side.

19
00:01:14,882 --> 00:01:18,136
Its guard: it is not a
web, and not a ground.

20
00:01:18,937 --> 00:01:22,362
Spontaneous presence
says nothing is missing,

21
00:01:22,442 --> 00:01:27,063
and nothing is making it. Its guard
is double. It is not uncaused.

22
00:01:27,143 --> 00:01:29,359
Every appearing has its conditions.

23
00:01:29,439 --> 00:01:33,612
What is gone is the maker, not
the order. And it is not a source.

24
00:01:33,692 --> 00:01:37,367
Nothing stands behind
appearing, not even spontaneity.

25
00:01:38,189 --> 00:01:40,337
They are three angles on one face.

26
00:01:40,417 --> 00:01:44,037
Each is a whole description,
and none of them is the taste.

27
00:01:44,841 --> 00:01:48,592
None is higher. Not a lower
truth and a higher one.

28
00:01:48,672 --> 00:01:52,437
Not stages, first analysis
and then recognition.

29
00:01:52,517 --> 00:01:54,570
Nor does one turn into another.

30
00:01:54,650 --> 00:01:58,945
I do not say dependent arising
becomes spontaneous presence,

31
00:01:59,025 --> 00:02:01,799
any more than we say
summer becomes winter.

32
00:02:01,879 --> 00:02:04,407
That way of speaking
brings back a traveller,

33
00:02:04,487 --> 00:02:07,781
crossing from one to the
other. Nothing crosses.

34
00:02:08,581 --> 00:02:10,349
Anatta needs one note here.

35
00:02:10,429 --> 00:02:13,704
As the first insight, it
covers only the subject.

36
00:02:13,784 --> 00:02:17,414
The observer has disappeared,
but the world has not.

37
00:02:17,494 --> 00:02:20,416
But anatta is a seal, not a stage.

38
00:02:20,496 --> 00:02:23,868
As the seal, all dharmas are without self.

39
00:02:23,948 --> 00:02:28,868
Not only no seer behind seeing,
but no self-nature in the seen,

40
00:02:28,948 --> 00:02:31,177
in the cause, in the condition.

41
00:02:31,257 --> 00:02:34,968
Read as the seal, anatta
describes the whole taste,

42
00:02:35,048 --> 00:02:36,915
from the side of "no one".

43
00:02:37,909 --> 00:02:41,728
Freedom from all elaborations
is not a fourth description.

44
00:02:41,808 --> 00:02:43,712
It says nothing about the taste.

45
00:02:43,792 --> 00:02:47,045
It says only that nothing
reified is added to it.

46
00:02:47,853 --> 00:02:51,441
And spontaneous presence
adds nothing to the negation.

47
00:02:51,521 --> 00:02:55,667
It does not slip a positive
reality in behind the refutation.

48
00:02:55,747 --> 00:02:58,996
It names only what the
refutation never denied:

49
00:02:59,076 --> 00:03:02,691
the appearing itself, once
nothing is added to it.

50
00:03:02,771 --> 00:03:06,292
Heard as something found,
with a nature of its own,

51
00:03:06,372 --> 00:03:08,402
it would be taken apart too.

52
00:03:09,230 --> 00:03:11,528
The descriptions keep each other honest.

53
00:03:11,608 --> 00:03:16,596
Dependent arising keeps spontaneous
presence from being heard as coming from

54
00:03:16,676 --> 00:03:19,123
nowhere, or from a hidden ground.

55
00:03:19,203 --> 00:03:24,368
Spontaneous presence keeps dependent
arising from being heard as a machine of

56
00:03:24,448 --> 00:03:29,232
causes, working in the dark,
waiting for a knower to light it up.

57
00:03:29,312 --> 00:03:32,398
Clarity is never absent from what appears.

58
00:03:32,478 --> 00:03:37,130
The only question is whether it is
abstracted out and made into a thing.

59
00:03:37,949 --> 00:03:39,662
Keep two questions apart.

60
00:03:39,742 --> 00:03:41,659
How does this appearing come about?

61
00:03:41,739 --> 00:03:47,739
Through causes and conditions, always.
What is its nature? Empty. Not produced.

62
00:03:47,854 --> 00:03:50,169
So "why" has nothing to point to.

63
00:03:50,299 --> 00:03:53,888
"Beyond cause and effect"
answers the second question.

64
00:03:53,968 --> 00:03:55,899
It never cancels the first.

65
00:03:55,979 --> 00:03:59,771
It means beyond intrinsic
cause and intrinsic effect,

66
00:03:59,851 --> 00:04:02,262
never beyond dependent arising.

67
00:04:03,081 --> 00:04:04,717
Now the many faces.

68
00:04:05,693 --> 00:04:08,929
From the taste, I
recognise its many faces,

69
00:04:09,009 --> 00:04:11,361
in very different situations.

70
00:04:11,441 --> 00:04:16,388
A sound, a thought, a flash of
anger, a cause and its effect,

71
00:04:16,468 --> 00:04:20,224
a stretch of time, a
death, washing the dishes.

72
00:04:21,041 --> 00:04:24,507
It is much like an AI model
that recognises faces.

73
00:04:24,587 --> 00:04:27,972
It knows a face across
light, angle and age.

74
00:04:28,052 --> 00:04:30,526
Not because it has stored one photograph,

75
00:04:30,606 --> 00:04:33,352
but because it has learned
the face's structure.

76
00:04:33,432 --> 00:04:37,727
A sameness of structure is what
mathematicians call an isomorphism.

77
00:04:37,807 --> 00:04:43,234
Once the taste is known, it is recognised
by its shape, wherever it shows up.

78
00:04:44,037 --> 00:04:45,818
A death, for instance.

79
00:04:45,898 --> 00:04:49,188
Conventionally someone has
died, and that is mourned.

80
00:04:49,268 --> 00:04:51,022
But no one is found who goes.

81
00:04:51,102 --> 00:04:53,862
Nothing that was there from
its own side is cut off.

82
00:04:53,942 --> 00:04:59,391
And the grief, vivid as it is, has
nothing behind it. The shape is the same.

83
00:04:59,471 --> 00:05:04,029
No one behind it, nothing standing
on its own, nothing missing.

84
00:05:04,876 --> 00:05:07,260
Four things keep this recognition honest.

85
00:05:08,123 --> 00:05:09,809
First, name the shape.

86
00:05:09,889 --> 00:05:13,885
No doer, nothing standing
on its own, nothing added,

87
00:05:13,965 --> 00:05:16,336
complete as its conditions meet.

88
00:05:17,158 --> 00:05:19,909
Second, no one is doing the recognising.

89
00:05:20,039 --> 00:05:22,282
"I recognise" is a way of speaking.

90
00:05:22,362 --> 00:05:28,016
The recognising is itself an appearing,
with no recogniser standing behind it.

91
00:05:28,096 --> 00:05:31,254
And the comparison stops
at "known by its shape".

92
00:05:31,370 --> 00:05:34,402
Familiarity is a condition
among conditions,

93
00:05:34,482 --> 00:05:36,770
not a store sitting behind the seeing.

94
00:05:37,613 --> 00:05:40,604
Third, the shape does not carry across.

95
00:05:40,684 --> 00:05:43,729
Nothing stable sits inside each situation,

96
00:05:43,809 --> 00:05:45,441
passing to the next.

97
00:05:45,521 --> 00:05:49,150
If the taste became an
essence present in everything,

98
00:05:49,230 --> 00:05:50,889
it would be the ground again.

99
00:05:50,969 --> 00:05:53,095
Same form, not same stuff.

100
00:05:53,937 --> 00:05:56,344
Fourth, recognition can misfire.

101
00:05:56,424 --> 00:05:59,741
A model can match the
wrong face, and so can we.

102
00:05:59,821 --> 00:06:05,162
The I AM presence, a blank quiet,
a refined oneness made of one

103
00:06:05,242 --> 00:06:10,012
luminosity: each can look like
the taste. The test is the shape.

104
00:06:10,092 --> 00:06:13,694
Is a witness, a source or
a background still left?

105
00:06:13,774 --> 00:06:15,434
Is something being kept up?

106
00:06:15,514 --> 00:06:18,318
Here the logic keeps
the recognition honest.

107
00:06:19,125 --> 00:06:20,951
So what does the view taste like?

108
00:06:21,782 --> 00:06:26,376
Held properly, it is tasted in
every appearing in six ways.

109
00:06:26,456 --> 00:06:29,682
In Tibetan, the first
has a phrase of its own:

110
00:06:29,785 --> 00:06:32,753
vividly appearing, yet unfindable.

111
00:06:33,557 --> 00:06:36,208
Vividly appearing yet unfindable.

112
00:06:36,288 --> 00:06:39,958
The colour is as bright as
ever, the sound as clear.

113
00:06:40,038 --> 00:06:43,626
And when you look for what the
name stands for, nothing is found.

114
00:06:43,706 --> 00:06:45,596
Unfindable does not dim it.

115
00:06:45,676 --> 00:06:48,644
Vividness never needed anything findable.

116
00:06:49,449 --> 00:06:50,456
Centerless.

117
00:06:50,536 --> 00:06:55,768
No doer stands behind seeing, and no
one sits at the middle of what appears.

118
00:06:55,848 --> 00:06:57,983
The sound is not heard from a point.

119
00:06:58,063 --> 00:07:01,561
There is only the hearing,
and the hearing is the sound.

120
00:07:02,365 --> 00:07:05,505
Mutual. Each appears only with the others.

121
00:07:05,585 --> 00:07:07,883
The sound with the ear and the air.

122
00:07:07,963 --> 00:07:09,554
The thrower with the catcher.

123
00:07:09,634 --> 00:07:12,923
And the relations are not found
from their own side either.

124
00:07:13,003 --> 00:07:15,278
So this is not a web behind things.

125
00:07:16,083 --> 00:07:17,009
Seamless.

126
00:07:17,089 --> 00:07:21,628
No gap opens between one moment and
the next that would need a carrier or a

127
00:07:21,708 --> 00:07:25,446
bridge. Seamless does
not mean merged into One.

128
00:07:25,526 --> 00:07:28,467
Sight stays sight, and sound stays sound.

129
00:07:29,277 --> 00:07:30,229
Effortless.

130
00:07:30,309 --> 00:07:34,224
Nothing produces the appearing,
and nothing has to keep it going.

131
00:07:34,304 --> 00:07:36,751
Conditions meet, and this appears.

132
00:07:36,831 --> 00:07:39,876
There is nothing to hold,
so nothing to maintain.

133
00:07:39,956 --> 00:07:41,742
Maintenance is the split.

134
00:07:42,553 --> 00:07:46,848
Intimate. No distance stands
between a knower and what is known.

135
00:07:46,928 --> 00:07:49,253
The appearing is clear as it appears.

136
00:07:49,333 --> 00:07:52,708
Nothing lights it, not
another, and not itself.

137
00:07:53,538 --> 00:07:56,801
These six describe the
appearing, conventionally.

138
00:07:56,881 --> 00:08:00,211
How it is met when the habit
of fixing is not running.

139
00:08:00,291 --> 00:08:03,485
They do not describe
emptiness as something found.

140
00:08:03,565 --> 00:08:08,024
Emptiness stays what it always
was: the absence of own-nature,

141
00:08:08,104 --> 00:08:10,256
a negation and nothing more.

142
00:08:11,073 --> 00:08:14,145
And they are not six
states to reach or to keep.

143
00:08:14,225 --> 00:08:18,805
They are how the appearing tastes
when the view is lived, not only held.

144
00:08:18,885 --> 00:08:23,280
If one of them is taken up as a goal,
the doer comes back to chase it.

145
00:08:24,098 --> 00:08:25,599
That brings the guards.

146
00:08:26,417 --> 00:08:32,417
Not only concepts. Designated does not
mean unreal or arbitrary. Things work.

147
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:35,281
Harm is harm. Actions bear fruit.

148
00:08:36,093 --> 00:08:39,559
Not uncaused. Every
appearing has its conditions.

149
00:08:39,639 --> 00:08:42,389
What is gone is the
producer, not the order.

150
00:08:43,201 --> 00:08:45,132
Not a web, not a ground.

151
00:08:45,212 --> 00:08:48,229
The relations are no more
found than the things.

152
00:08:48,309 --> 00:08:50,285
Emptiness is not a new something.

153
00:08:51,101 --> 00:08:53,072
Not a stage to leave behind.

154
00:08:53,152 --> 00:08:56,501
The framework is not the
prison. Reifying it is.

155
00:08:57,321 --> 00:09:01,548
Not a state to keep. Seeing
dependence is not kept up by effort.

156
00:09:01,628 --> 00:09:04,881
It is seen, and in time the habit loosens.

157
00:09:05,701 --> 00:09:09,520
In fact, every mistake on
this path has the same shape:

158
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:12,147
the doer, put back somewhere else.

159
00:09:12,953 --> 00:09:17,139
After anatta, a vast
Awareness, a pure witness,

160
00:09:17,219 --> 00:09:19,218
in which everything happens.

161
00:09:19,298 --> 00:09:21,310
The seer in a larger coat.

162
00:09:21,390 --> 00:09:25,984
In total exertion, a cosmic
whole present in each moment,

163
00:09:26,064 --> 00:09:29,381
or a fluid substrate
flowing under the verbs.

164
00:09:29,461 --> 00:09:34,462
In dependent arising, a web, a
mechanism standing behind things.

165
00:09:34,542 --> 00:09:38,973
In spontaneous presence, a source
that gives off appearances,

166
00:09:39,053 --> 00:09:43,117
or appearances without causes:
the demand for a producer,

167
00:09:43,197 --> 00:09:45,472
granted one final exemption.

168
00:09:46,293 --> 00:09:51,077
In the marketplace, the helper who
has arrived and now saves others.

169
00:09:51,157 --> 00:09:53,849
Or the bystander who says it is all empty,

170
00:09:53,929 --> 00:09:55,520
so nothing needs doing.

171
00:09:55,600 --> 00:10:01,022
And no licence: "no one there, so no
consequences" is the annihilation view

172
00:10:01,102 --> 00:10:02,302
again.

173
00:10:02,737 --> 00:10:05,225
And in practice, a state to keep up.

174
00:10:05,305 --> 00:10:10,089
Maintenance would be the split again.
None of this is kept. It was always so.

175
00:10:10,169 --> 00:10:11,561
It is recognised.

176
00:10:12,365 --> 00:10:14,567
Do I depart from the great masters?

177
00:10:14,647 --> 00:10:16,225
Their definitions differ.

178
00:10:16,305 --> 00:10:19,395
At the core, I do not
believe mine deviates.

179
00:10:20,206 --> 00:10:22,816
The Buddha: when this is, that is.

180
00:10:22,896 --> 00:10:25,697
Who sees dependent
arising sees the Dhamma.

181
00:10:25,777 --> 00:10:29,868
The middle way between "is"
and "is not". I hold the same.

182
00:10:29,948 --> 00:10:33,768
Nāgārjuna: dependent arising is emptiness,

183
00:10:33,848 --> 00:10:37,001
a designation in
dependence, the middle way.

184
00:10:37,081 --> 00:10:41,349
Without arising, without
ceasing, stilling elaboration.

185
00:10:41,429 --> 00:10:43,890
The same, in all three uses.

186
00:10:43,970 --> 00:10:49,569
Candrakīrti: the chariot, found neither
among its parts nor apart from them,

187
00:10:49,649 --> 00:10:53,605
and conventions left as the
world uses them. The same.

188
00:10:53,685 --> 00:10:55,470
The chariot was my bridge.

189
00:10:56,306 --> 00:10:59,922
Tsongkhapa: dependence
on causes, on parts,

190
00:11:00,002 --> 00:11:03,224
and most subtly on being
designated by mind.

191
00:11:03,304 --> 00:11:07,748
Dependent arising is the king of
reasons. The same at the core.

192
00:11:07,828 --> 00:11:13,459
Gorampa and Mipham: appearance
and emptiness in union. Close.

193
00:11:14,273 --> 00:11:19,369
Dzogchen says spontaneous presence
is not made by causes and conditions.

194
00:11:19,449 --> 00:11:25,022
Here the equation I make most often,
dependent arising is spontaneous presence,

195
00:11:25,102 --> 00:11:27,997
is understood in the orthodox texts too.

196
00:11:28,077 --> 00:11:32,263
Nāgārjuna praises dependent
arising as without arising.

197
00:11:32,343 --> 00:11:38,323
Candrakīrti quotes a sūtra: whatever
is born from conditions is unborn.

198
00:11:38,403 --> 00:11:42,549
So "not made by causes"
means unborn by nature.

199
00:11:42,629 --> 00:11:45,918
Appearing through conditions,
yet nothing produced,

200
00:11:45,998 --> 00:11:49,247
no maker, no birth from its own side.

201
00:11:49,327 --> 00:11:53,812
I part only from a reading that makes
spontaneous presence an unconditioned

202
00:11:53,892 --> 00:11:59,102
ground. I read Longchenpa's
ground as empty, as Mipham does.

203
00:11:59,901 --> 00:12:01,945
Where I do part, I say so.

204
00:12:02,788 --> 00:12:05,480
From Tsongkhapa, on three points.

205
00:12:05,560 --> 00:12:09,542
What anatta means: mine is
the experiential insight,

206
00:12:09,622 --> 00:12:14,569
no seer in seeing, which can come
first while things are still reified.

207
00:12:14,649 --> 00:12:18,944
Read as the seal, it is his
selflessness of all things.

208
00:12:19,024 --> 00:12:22,137
The order of the path:
his is the view first.

209
00:12:22,217 --> 00:12:26,077
Mine was the taste first, and
the view syncing with it later.

210
00:12:26,157 --> 00:12:28,691
A difference of route, not of content.

211
00:12:28,807 --> 00:12:34,067
Freedom from all elaborations still came
only after the logic had done its work.

212
00:12:34,147 --> 00:12:38,088
And the bridge across time: I
keep neither carried nor cut,

213
00:12:38,168 --> 00:12:39,791
with no bridge needed.

214
00:12:40,667 --> 00:12:43,087
From Huayan and modern interbeing.

215
00:12:43,167 --> 00:12:47,217
Nothing stands alone, but the
relations are not found either.

216
00:12:47,297 --> 00:12:49,314
There is no net behind things.

217
00:12:50,121 --> 00:12:54,733
And on its status. I hold dependent
arising as an enlightened view,

218
00:12:54,822 --> 00:12:56,196
not a lower truth.

219
00:12:56,276 --> 00:13:01,866
And not the pattern of ignorance, but the
antidote by which ignorance is undone.

220
00:13:02,677 --> 00:13:04,381
What I add is a few words.

221
00:13:04,511 --> 00:13:08,403
"Taste", "encounters" and
"many faces" are mine.

222
00:13:09,222 --> 00:13:11,710
These are my readings, not the schools'.

223
00:13:11,790 --> 00:13:16,140
Some lineages see it differently, and
you should read them for yourself.

224
00:13:16,220 --> 00:13:19,278
All views and understanding
here are my own,

225
00:13:19,358 --> 00:13:21,710
from my practice and contemplation.

226
00:13:21,790 --> 00:13:25,791
I do not represent any
tradition, school or teacher.

227
00:13:26,589 --> 00:13:29,117
Try it. Listen to a sound nearby.

228
00:13:29,197 --> 00:13:31,622
A car, a fan, a voice.

229
00:13:32,425 --> 00:13:34,451
Look for the hearer behind the hearing.

230
00:13:34,531 --> 00:13:36,489
Is anyone there, receiving it?

231
00:13:36,569 --> 00:13:38,377
Then look at the hearing itself.

232
00:13:38,457 --> 00:13:40,470
Is a process running underneath?

233
00:13:40,550 --> 00:13:43,028
Or just sound, with no effort at all?

234
00:13:43,869 --> 00:13:48,980
Find its conditions. The source,
the air, the ear, attention.

235
00:13:49,060 --> 00:13:52,621
Is any of them standing behind
the sound, pushing it out?

236
00:13:52,701 --> 00:13:56,579
The sound is not made by them and
sent out. It is their meeting.

237
00:13:57,393 --> 00:14:01,226
Change one condition. Cover
one ear, or turn your head.

238
00:14:01,306 --> 00:14:05,361
It is not the same sound, altered.
It is a different appearing.

239
00:14:06,181 --> 00:14:09,307
Look for the "between"
that joins the conditions.

240
00:14:09,387 --> 00:14:13,193
Did any of this need a hearer
behind it, a web underneath,

241
00:14:13,273 --> 00:14:16,264
or a power in the cause?
Then stop looking.

242
00:14:16,344 --> 00:14:21,590
The sound is complete, exactly as its
conditions meet. Do not try to keep this.

243
00:14:21,670 --> 00:14:24,638
When the next sound
comes, it is complete too.

244
00:14:25,457 --> 00:14:29,548
Later in the day, when a thought
or a flash of irritation comes,

245
00:14:29,628 --> 00:14:32,496
look for the same shape. Anyone behind it?

246
00:14:32,576 --> 00:14:35,961
Anything in it standing on
its own? Anything missing?

247
00:14:36,041 --> 00:14:39,118
Recognise the face. Do not hold on to it.

248
00:14:39,933 --> 00:14:42,421
If you think you understand, keep looking.

249
00:14:42,501 --> 00:14:44,871
The same taste has many faces.

250
00:14:45,686 --> 00:14:49,139
There is one more part,
a draft: five elements,

251
00:14:49,219 --> 00:14:52,866
five lights, rainbow body. That is Part 6.

